// AWS S3 Bucket Policy Modified  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1537
// Detects changes to an S3 bucket policy (PutBucketPolicy). Attackers grant access to an external principal/'*' to exfiltrate data. Inspect…
// False positives: Legitimate bucket policy changes (review the granted principals).
// Source: rules/exfiltration/s3-put-bucket-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^PutBucketPolicy$/i eventSource=/^s3\.amazonaws\.com$/i
